# Stilwell Farms -- town investment art (biz.c, invest.c). Generated by a small compositor that draws in the
# palettes' colours and picks each 8x8 quadrant's palette; edit pixels freely.
#
# Storefront kits, one per building style (CLASSIC MODERN CABIN COTTAGE), 16 metatiles each, in this order
# (biz.c indexes them): ROOF (3 cells), UP (upper windows L R), UPBOX (with window boxes), GND (display
# window, door, display window), AWN (the same under an awning), PATIO (awning + patio tables + door
# lanterns). The upper middle cell is the business's SIGN_* plaque.
#
# Town upgrades (paving, lights, boardwalk), the storefront kits and the signs stay near: the renderer
# reads them directly (they cover the town's streets and shopfronts). The rest is far (tools/gen_art.py).

# ---- near: town upgrades

